{
    "title": "Snake Run Race\u30fb3D Running Game",
    "description": "3, 2, 1! It\u2019s racing time! Dive into the world of this racing game to get to the finish line safe and sound and become the racing legend! \ud83c\udfc3\ud83c\udfc1\r\n\r\nSlither through the obstacle course of this 3D racing game and outrun your snake rivals to become the champion! Get into the crazy rush to win in Snake Run Race:3D Running Game! \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udc0d\r\n\r\nRemember the fun worm game that was popular back in time? The main difference is that Snake Run Race:3D Running Game has high-quality and vivid graphics, a gripping obstacle course, and plenty of snake rivals that will slither with you on the racing track. \ud83c\udfc1 The crazy rush of our run game will steal your breath away! Just slither into the epic race to have some fun! \ud83c\udf08\r\n\r\nOur running game will become your savior in long lines and during boring or sleepless hours at home. Just slither into the crazy rush filled with incredible 3D racing challenges, adorable snake rivals, and colorful levels to brighten up your humdrum routine with our run game. \ud83c\udfc3\ud83c\udfae\r\n\r\nObstacle Course with Snakes \ud83d\udc0d\r\nYou\u2019re not the only runner in this fun race! There are other snakes that will run on the racing track with you! \ud83c\udfc3 Eat your snake rivals along with orbs to prolong and slither through the levels of this running game! Be careful: don\u2019t let bigger snake rivals eat you up like they do with little worms and don\u2019t let your snake crash into them to avoid a snake clash! This will only lead to the restart of your 3D racing. Calculate your moves in this endless runner to beat the obstacle course! \ud83c\udfc1\r\n\r\nEpic Race with Plenty of Quests \ud83c\udfc6\r\nOur worm game will surprise you with its challenges! You can slither into the epic race, not letting your snake crash into hurdles or snake rivals to prevent a snake clash in the epic race 3D. \ud83d\udc0d This way you\u2019ll earn lovely little hats or incredible skins that will upgrade you from a wiggly worm to a stylish \u201ccolor snake\u201d! Or try a change of pace from the fun run and check out our mini-game, where your snake will become the worst nightmare of the villagers on the small island, feeding itself to grow from a little worm to a fantastic beast in this runner!\r\n\r\nRacing as a New Brainteaser \ud83e\udde0\r\nLead your snake to the title of the epic race 3D champion in our running sim! Put your running skills to the test to prove you can be quick as a snake and not as sluggish as worms in this endless runner. Think before you act to not let your snake crash into anything in this fun race 3D so you won\u2019t get into a snake clash. This endless runner will help to keep your mind sharp or to switch your focus with some fun run tasks!\r\n\r\nWith this fun race simulator, you will forget other casual games and snakes games! \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae Simple snake games mechanics: Merge other worms to evolve from a little worm to a giant \u201ccolor snake\u201d, avoid barriers, and finish your run 3D challenge to become a legend of the epic race 3D!\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Bright worm games: You\u2019ll love this fun race 3D for its cute snakes and cartoonish design of tracks for running! Other 3D run and fun race sims are not that exciting!\r\n\ud83c\udfc3 Thrilling run 3D challenges: Go down as the top runner in the history of fun run & casual games and complete every race and all snakes games of our run game!\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Brain-teasing race: Don\u2019t just run in this fun race\u2014you have to calculate your every move to help your \u201ccolor snake\u201d win the race, avoiding any snake battle!\r\n\ud83d\udc0d Nostalgic snake games! Snake Run Race:3D Running Game will be special for those players who were truly in love with the old snake run race 3D from their childhood!\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s time you start your run 3D challenge to beat this fun race 3D in our run game! Ready to run faster than the lightning to win this snake battle for speed in our obstacle course game? Then dive into the world of these worm games and get into the snake run race 3D! \ud83c\udfc3\ud83c\udfc1\r\n\r\nDownload Snake Run Race:3D Running Game now and go through this obstacle course to get to the finish line! Win this exciting snake battle for speed to become the 3D run master! \ud83d\udc0d\ud83c\udfc6\ud83c\udfc1",
